[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7989.669, "timestamp": "02:13:09", "text": "去，而且我当时和我的律师关系还不错，所以我也问他能不能看看这个隐私政策，问问他对这个政策有什么看法。我问了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7993.83, "timestamp": "02:13:13", "text": "上次我去的时候也发给了几个朋友，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7996.79, "timestamp": "02:13:16", "text": "如果我没记错的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8000.149, "timestamp": "02:13:20", "text": "他们说“好吧，还行”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8002.872, "timestamp": "02:13:22", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8003.43, "timestamp": "02:13:23", "text": "[笑] 还"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8008.39, "timestamp": "02:13:28", "text": "不错，但是说实话，是啊，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8010.55, "timestamp": "02:13:30", "text": "啊。特别是这些东西，我也得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8013.03, "timestamp": "02:13:33", "text": "改改。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8017.51, "timestamp": "02:13:37", "text": "或者我得加个警告或者什么标记，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8020.31, "timestamp": "02:13:40", "text": "说有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8023.589, "timestamp": "02:13:43", "text": "东西还在修改中，暂时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8027.109, "timestamp": "02:13:47", "text": "不能生效，所以别担心之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8029.727, "timestamp": "02:13:49", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8031.037, "timestamp": "02:13:51", "text": "[嗤笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8036.069, "timestamp": "02:13:56", "text": "我还记得我做这一切的初衷，就是"}]